{"id": 1010413, "slug": "bratz-rhythm-style", "name": "Bratz Rhythm & Style", "name_original": "Bratz Rhythm & Style", "description": "Please note: Controller required for 2-4 player split screen mode. <br/><br/><p>Travel to 6 style cities including London, Milan, and Tokyo.</p><p>Start a fashion and dance adventure with your BFFs, the Bratz Pack!</p><p>Rule the runway and take the stage with Cloe, Yasmin, Sasha, and Jade. Conquer the world in style, creating customizable fashions in the Bratz Fashion Studios. Showcase your signature looks and groove to your favorite songs from the Bratz universe, including ‘So Good’.</p><p>Customize your outfits, hairstyles, and makeup.</p><p>Jet off to iconic cities, from Paris to Tokyo, but watch out for – self-proclaimed “Style Queen”, Burdine and the Tweevil Twins who are determined to steal the spotlight. Can you out-style and out-dance them in epic fashion battles?</p><p> </p><p>Take on the challenge – party in single or multiplayer with up to four players.</p><p>Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz.</p><p>It's time to express yourself!</p><p> <strong>FASHION TOUR -</strong> Travel to 6 style cities including London, Milan, and Tokyo.</p><p><strong>WALK THE RUNWAY -</strong> Compete in fashion show, dancing, and fitness games.</p><p><strong>DESIGN NEW STYLES -</strong> Customize your outfits, hairstyles, and makeup.</p><p> <strong>PLAY TOGETHER –</strong> Play solo or enjoy with your best friends, up to four players.</p><p> <strong>ICONIC STYLE –</strong> Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-09-12", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-09-15T08:40:01", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/81e/81e3781051debb87d5c7bc6ddf42ae72.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/34f/34f1faa48ff6c631ada0934c1561b22a.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "rea