, but watch out for – self-proclaimed “Style Queen”, Burdine and the Tweevil Twins who are determined to steal the spotlight. Can you out-style and out-dance them in epic fashion battles? Take on the challenge – party in single or multiplayer with up to four players.Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz.It's time to express yourself! FASHION TOUR - Travel to 6 style cities including London, Milan, and Tokyo.WALK THE RUNWAY - Compete in fashion show, dancing, and fitness games.DESIGN NEW STYLES - Customize your outfits, hairstyles, and makeup. PLAY TOGETHER – Play solo or enjoy with your best friends, up to four players. ICONIC STYLE – Enter the instantly recognizable 3D world of Bratz."}